• What circular business model better meet users' needs? Are my key customers willing to receive a service instead that a product?
• How the product can be better designed to meet the circular business model? 
• How the service can be better designed to incentive users to use my service?
• Would users be willing to rent our product with a long-term contract? 
• Which additional service could be combined with the product or service to generate more revenue?
• What should I change about the design of my product to make it last for many life cycles?